{"v":3,"catch":"阻止 BEM 建造敵方火箭！","desc":"《SPACE CYCLONE》是 TAITO 於 1980 年推出的射擊遊戲。\n當 BEM（昆蟲型機械人）出現在天空中，並透過在隕石間傳送入侵時，請將牠們擊落。千萬別讓 BEM 著陸！牠們會建造火箭飛向天空，並用致命的「旋風射擊」轟炸你！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請欣賞成就一代電子遊戲的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2026-06-18","genres":["街機","射擊"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","義大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"保護級","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/35bbf1c4ab2a071e7e50397b7f785bd370188bb26a8a4b23accd57552bfc68e6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0f96f02ca7a9f77f3ae7f8163e88a162fe691f24ca057bebe8dda3c01ef0d6bf.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/73109930baadf0fc2eb0695d9daa24c6844a57984b22e413a3d5472a24ddde7d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/57c8faaa8f52ab6305b91bdc38115a3d0cb04e0aa07c52453d4caf1845a3011d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4a5497e09b65c2244c406258af33ec26c65ef3231d946781208adca104662f2b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1071fc39dd6f71c82e139cd8ea8eea089f2eb656a6a28d6a1e6e2a3a976ca3cb.jpg"],"titleId":"010005f027680000","dlc":[]}